WEBVTT

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.667
Somebody, help me!

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:53.000
Why am I here?

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.542
Tsugumi, transform into a weapon!

00:00:55.542 --> 00:00:58.000
No way! I can't!

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:01.208
I can't fight...!

00:01:09.208 --> 00:01:12.125
No!!

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:26.208
Wandering around half-asleep again...

00:01:37.917 --> 00:01:39.375
Perv.

00:02:22.458 --> 00:02:25.000
Is this what being homesick is?

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.792
I've got to get it together.

00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:38.542
Oh, Miss Tsugumi, awake already?

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.458
My glasses, my glasses...

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:49.125
Miss Meme, you don't wear glasses, do you?

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.458
Huh? I don't?

00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:53.708
You're still only half awake.

00:02:54.958 --> 00:02:56.500
Good morning, you two!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.667
--Good morning.
--Morning.

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:01.292
I'm gonna go wash my face.

00:03:01.292 --> 00:03:02.917
Come back soon!

00:03:02.917 --> 00:03:05.667
What should we do for breakfast this morning?

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:08.417
Talking about food right
after we wake up, are we?

00:03:08.417 --> 00:03:11.125
--Huh?
--You're a surprisingly big eater.

00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:13.333
I was just getting on the
same page as you, Miss Tsugumi!

00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:14.750
Is that right?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.542
Geez! I'm going to go wash my face, too!

00:03:17.542 --> 00:03:19.833
Come back soon!

00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:22.000
Oh, me too!

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:30.292
<i>we wanna be there even if we had to</i>
<i>twist the world all around to get there</i>

00:03:30.292 --> 00:03:41.167
<i>without you, i guess i couldn't</i>
<i>even find the future here today</i>

00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:52.167
<i>i was always trying to take nothing for granted</i>

00:03:52.167 --> 00:04:00.167
<i>for the day i might lose them</i>

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:07.208
<i>but you just came in to my black</i>
<i>and white monochrome destiny</i>

00:04:07.208 --> 00:04:17.375
<i>and colored it all over</i>

00:04:18.208 --> 00:04:24.750
<i>we won't be satisfied with the routine future</i>

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:32.208
<i>we were born to make a new history come true</i>

00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:39.375
<i>there's absolutely no</i>
<i>absolute thing in this world</i>

00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:43.958
<i>this road goes on forever</i>

00:04:43.958 --> 00:04:50.083
<i>as long as we won't give up</i>

00:04:53.083 --> 00:04:56.583
Why did I come to DWMA, you ask?

00:04:56.583 --> 00:05:00.250
As a weapon, it didn't seem
to me that I had much choice,

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.750
but I was wondering what
your reasons were, as meisters.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:06.333
Hmm... I've forgotten.

00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:09.375
Huh? Something as important as that?

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:11.458
Well, how about you, Miss Anya?

00:05:11.458 --> 00:05:15.750
Why should I have to tell
that to you, Miss Tsugumi?

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.792
Uh, well, I...

00:05:17.792 --> 00:05:19.792
Come, it's almost time for class.

00:05:19.792 --> 00:05:23.542
Oh. This is a meister class, right?

00:05:23.542 --> 00:05:26.458
Yes. Well, see you later.

00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:34.708
"Waver, Run!"

00:05:36.292 --> 00:05:38.458
If I could hear at least one good example,

00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:42.792
I could understand how to
survive the chaotic DWMA life here.

00:05:44.542 --> 00:05:46.458
Harudori?

00:05:46.458 --> 00:05:48.167
A-Akane...

00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:50.542
You seem kind of down somehow.

00:05:50.542 --> 00:05:52.875
No, I wouldn't say that.

00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:56.417
Akane, is it all right for you
to not attend the meister class?

00:05:56.417 --> 00:05:59.083
Yeah, it looks like it's okay for me.

00:05:59.083 --> 00:06:02.458
Right now, the classes
are teaching the fundamentals.

00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:04.250
Oh, yeah?

00:06:05.167 --> 00:06:09.792
Um, Akane, there's something
I wanted to ask you...

00:06:09.792 --> 00:06:12.458
Would you mind a little of your time?

00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:28.833
So your question is, why do
the meisters come to DWMA?

00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:31.875
Uh, yes. Why would you go to the trouble,

00:06:31.875 --> 00:06:34.458
knowing you'll be exposed to danger?

00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:36.375
Good question.

00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:39.250
I don't think there's just one reason,

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:43.208
but typically, I think many
are here with a career in mind.

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:45.375
A career?

00:06:45.375 --> 00:06:49.375
DWMA is sometimes called the world's police.

00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:52.042
There are more than a few
DWMA graduates in the political circles

00:06:52.042 --> 00:06:54.083
of countries around the world.

00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:58.500
In that context, the trust
placed in DWMA is tremendous.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.792
Most countries affiliate themselves with DWMA.

00:07:01.792 --> 00:07:05.917
That is also the reason why
DWMA prospers the way it does.

00:07:05.917 --> 00:07:09.542
If peace could be bought with money,
it wouldn't be so costly.

00:07:09.542 --> 00:07:12.083
The allowance that we DWMA students receive

00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:15.417
is just a bit on the
hefty side, don't you think?

00:07:15.417 --> 00:07:16.833
Indeed I do.

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:19.417
I hear that the way we DWMA
students manage our allowance

00:07:19.417 --> 00:07:22.750
is all checked up on.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.542
Please be mindful.

00:07:24.542 --> 00:07:28.958
It's another way that your
quality as a student is evaluated.

00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:33.458
Now, the way I make it sound,

00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:36.875
you may think there are many
here who are in it for the authority,

00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:38.417
but DWMA's motto is,

00:07:38.417 --> 00:07:42.875
"A sound soul dwells within
a sound mind and a sound body."

00:07:42.875 --> 00:07:45.292
Put simply, the majority of those who are here

00:07:45.292 --> 00:07:47.833
want to become the heroes
who save the world, I'd bet.

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:50.417
So then, Akane, are you here to be a hero, too?

00:07:50.417 --> 00:07:55.125
Hmm, in my case, I guess you
could say it's for family reasons.

00:07:55.125 --> 00:07:57.708
Like, your family has been
DWMA students for generations?

00:07:57.708 --> 00:07:59.167
No.

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:02.917
I was born into a family that runs a dojo.

00:08:02.917 --> 00:08:06.458
It's a dojo that still teaches
the ancient martial arts,

00:08:06.458 --> 00:08:08.542
including techniques of lethal force.

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:14.333
Harudori, have you ever heard of the Star Clan?

00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:16.167
Mm-mm.

00:08:16.167 --> 00:08:19.625
They're a group of assassins,
who will kill anyone for money.

00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:24.333
The Star Clan amounts to being a
branch of the school my family runs.

00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:27.167
The reason I usually wear glasses

00:08:27.167 --> 00:08:29.833
is also due to the rather
unpleasant look in my eye.

00:08:33.292 --> 00:08:34.875
What pretty eyes.

00:08:34.875 --> 00:08:37.833
Since I had already had
these techniques drilled into me,

00:08:37.833 --> 00:08:40.583
I thought I would use them to help others.

00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:44.292
Then, Akane, you plan to move
forward into the EAT class?

00:08:44.292 --> 00:08:46.000
Yes, I do.

00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:49.167
I respect that--

00:08:49.167 --> 00:08:53.292
being able to conduct yourself
so firmly after your own thinking.

00:08:53.292 --> 00:08:56.500
I'm here because I just happen to be a weapon,

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:01.125
and I'm not sure what I want
to strive toward in the future.

00:09:01.125 --> 00:09:05.958
Oh, I'm sorry! I didn't mean
for this to become a sob session!

00:09:05.958 --> 00:09:07.667
Sorry.

00:09:13.042 --> 00:09:15.667
You're kind of cute, huh, Harudori?

00:09:15.667 --> 00:09:19.042
N-No, I-I'm not cute!

00:09:19.042 --> 00:09:22.708
So then, Harudori, do you
want to try going into EAT, too?

00:09:22.708 --> 00:09:28.625
Eh? That's impossible! If I went
into EAT, it would cost me my life!

00:09:28.625 --> 00:09:32.375
I was freaked out just running
into one of those Traitor people.

00:09:32.375 --> 00:09:35.208
EAT would be out of the question.

00:09:35.208 --> 00:09:38.458
I will watch out for you.

00:09:38.458 --> 00:09:41.833
If you go into EAT, Harudori,
then I can protect you,

00:09:41.833 --> 00:09:44.667
whether it's from a Traitor or anything else.

00:09:44.667 --> 00:09:47.083
Huh? B-But...

00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:51.042
For that to happen, I need to have you near me.

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:53.250
Eep! N-Near you?

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.875
Would you be mine?

00:10:03.917 --> 00:10:05.417
Harudori...

00:10:06.917 --> 00:10:08.625
Akane...

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.875
You... are mine...

00:10:20.167 --> 00:10:25.375
I, who was in love with love,
am actually falling in love, right?

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.125
I'm joking.

00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:34.208
Huh?

00:10:34.208 --> 00:10:37.792
Harudori, you've only been
at DWMA for two weeks, right?

00:10:37.792 --> 00:10:40.917
While you may not know what
you want, or what your goal is,

00:10:40.917 --> 00:10:43.375
there's no reason to rush into it.

00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:46.792
If you still have concerns after a year,

00:10:46.792 --> 00:10:48.917
then I will find something for you.

00:10:51.917 --> 00:10:56.667
As for weapons, including myself,
there are the following theories:

00:10:56.667 --> 00:10:59.292
One, you are the descendent of a family line

00:10:59.292 --> 00:11:01.958
that has weapon genetic information.

00:11:01.958 --> 00:11:03.958
Two, it is widely observed that your abilities

00:11:03.958 --> 00:11:06.458
start exhibiting themselves at puberty.

00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:09.875
Three, there is a wide variety of weapon forms--

00:11:09.875 --> 00:11:11.542
Harudori! Are you listening?

00:11:11.542 --> 00:11:13.875
Y-Yes!

00:11:13.875 --> 00:11:17.875
Three, there is a wide
variety of weapon forms...

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.667
Excuse me, Clay?

00:11:25.042 --> 00:11:26.250
What?

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:29.542
Does Akane have anyone he's interested in?

00:11:29.542 --> 00:11:30.708
Huh?

00:11:30.708 --> 00:11:33.875
Or is he just always nice?

00:11:33.875 --> 00:11:36.833
Oh, come to think of it,
during that Traitor incident,

00:11:36.833 --> 00:11:39.625
he was awfully kind to Miss Anya, wasn't he?

00:11:40.583 --> 00:11:43.417
Has she caught on to our mission?

00:11:43.417 --> 00:11:47.833
Is it possible that Miss Anya
is the object of Akane's...

00:11:49.792 --> 00:11:50.958
...love?

00:11:50.958 --> 00:11:52.375
Eh?!

00:11:52.375 --> 00:11:54.708
Is that true?! No, it couldn't be!

00:11:54.708 --> 00:11:57.667
Harudori sure does get right to the point, huh?

00:11:57.667 --> 00:12:00.958
I'll have to completely play this off somehow.

00:12:00.958 --> 00:12:05.708
Ahem! Actually, the one Akane likes is Tatane.

00:12:07.875 --> 00:12:09.500
You mean Meme?!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:16.042
Y-Yeah, you know. All men like big boobs.

00:12:16.042 --> 00:12:17.250
All of them?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.583
N-No, not like that! Forget I said that!

00:12:20.583 --> 00:12:22.708
Huh? Forget it?

00:12:22.708 --> 00:12:27.542
The truth is, Harudori,
I'm the one who likes you...

00:12:27.542 --> 00:12:30.042
Eh?!

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:31.875
What do you mean?

00:12:31.875 --> 00:12:36.458
Let's see... And I like you, Harudori...

00:12:36.458 --> 00:12:38.042
What about Miss Anya?

00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:41.375
There...

00:12:41.375 --> 00:12:43.000
Done!

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.708
Huh?

00:12:44.708 --> 00:12:49.375
Since when did our relationships
turn so afternoon-soapy?

00:12:51.208 --> 00:12:52.667
Wh-What do we do?!

00:12:52.667 --> 00:12:56.250
In other words, to gloss it over,
you made it even worse.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.250
This is terrible. That poor girl.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.917
Right now, Harudori must have
her head buried in her hands.

00:13:02.917 --> 00:13:04.583
Don't say that.

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:07.625
I'll do what I can about this,

00:13:07.625 --> 00:13:11.167
but Clay, you're not cut out
for intelligence duty, are you?

00:13:12.792 --> 00:13:15.000
Don't say that.

00:13:21.375 --> 00:13:23.875
That just can't be it, can it?

00:13:23.875 --> 00:13:27.917
Why would Clay make up such a lie?

00:13:27.917 --> 00:13:30.917
Huh? Boys' feelings?

00:13:30.917 --> 00:13:36.667
Like, say, a boy asking a friend
who's a girl to be his as a joke,

00:13:36.667 --> 00:13:38.667
or they suddenly declare their love,

00:13:38.667 --> 00:13:41.625
but you soon realize it's just a lie, too.

00:13:42.958 --> 00:13:45.667
Something happened, didn't it, Tsugumi?

00:13:45.667 --> 00:13:48.417
No, I didn't mean anything particular by it.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.500
All right, I'll tell you.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.875
It's only natural for a
boy who is in love with a girl

00:13:54.875 --> 00:13:58.125
to think she's cute, right? I mean, to them,

00:13:58.125 --> 00:14:01.458
it's the same thing as courtship behavior.

00:14:01.458 --> 00:14:04.667
If you turn it around,
they just aren't quite as charming

00:14:04.667 --> 00:14:07.625
as we girls are when we talk
theoretically about boys and love.

00:14:07.625 --> 00:14:11.542
Eternal Feather, I'm sorry,
but can I see your notes from today?

00:14:11.542 --> 00:14:13.667
Mm-hmm, sure thing.

00:14:13.667 --> 00:14:14.667
Here.

00:14:14.667 --> 00:14:16.333
Thank you.

00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:19.208
Eternal Feather doesn't seem
like someone of the opposite sex,

00:14:19.208 --> 00:14:21.208
so she's nice and easily accessible, huh?

00:14:21.208 --> 00:14:22.667
That's true.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:29.333
Whether or not I'm popular
is a different matter, though.

00:14:31.833 --> 00:14:35.167
It's all right. Money makes the world go round.

00:14:39.625 --> 00:14:42.083
They're good upperclassmen, at least.

00:14:44.417 --> 00:14:46.958
Isn't there anyone I can turn to?

00:14:46.958 --> 00:14:50.125
Don't you get it?
Soul, if you had gotten up earlier,

00:14:50.125 --> 00:14:53.042
you would have been able
to eat the breakfast I made,

00:14:53.042 --> 00:14:55.792
and I wouldn't have kicked you
out that window when we fought!

00:14:55.792 --> 00:14:57.000
Geez, shut up.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.750
--Maka, ma'am?
--You're paying for the window and the car yourself!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.333
Oh, you're that freshman...

00:15:03.333 --> 00:15:04.583
Ah, you remember me--

00:15:04.583 --> 00:15:08.917
I once wore that uniform.

00:15:08.917 --> 00:15:11.958
DWMA has a really wide
variety of uniforms, right?

00:15:11.958 --> 00:15:13.750
You're free to pair any top and bottom,

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:15.542
and even street clothes are okay.

00:15:15.542 --> 00:15:17.417
Did you have lots of trouble choosing?

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:21.542
Oh, yes. I settled on this scarf and collar.

00:15:21.542 --> 00:15:24.458
Also, I don't have much of a figure, so...

00:15:27.208 --> 00:15:28.917
We're soulmates!

00:15:28.917 --> 00:15:29.875
Ow!

00:15:29.875 --> 00:15:32.167
Let's get going, already. We'll be tardy.

00:15:32.167 --> 00:15:35.083
Yeah, I know!

00:15:35.083 --> 00:15:36.750
See you later.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.042
Maka, ma'am!

00:15:39.042 --> 00:15:41.042
My name is Tsugumi.

00:15:41.042 --> 00:15:46.917
These twin tails are also
because of your influence. I'm sorry.

00:15:46.917 --> 00:15:50.083
Ha, it looks cute, Tsugumi.

00:15:51.458 --> 00:15:53.458
Um, Maka, ma'am...

00:15:53.458 --> 00:15:56.917
Uh, there's something troubling me right now...

00:15:56.917 --> 00:16:00.750
Do you know anything about dreams or love?

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.917
Don't worry.

00:16:02.917 --> 00:16:05.292
Like I said, it's your
fault in the first place, Soul!

00:16:05.292 --> 00:16:08.917
--Don't be silly! You're always blind to your own faults!
--Don't worry?

00:16:10.208 --> 00:16:12.458
Miss Kana!

00:16:12.458 --> 00:16:16.333
Miss Kana, please tell my fortune!

00:16:16.333 --> 00:16:17.333
About what?

00:16:17.333 --> 00:16:20.625
About love, and dreams,
the future, and my hopes!

00:16:20.625 --> 00:16:22.292
Everything about me!

00:16:28.042 --> 00:16:29.375
Go ahead.

00:16:31.333 --> 00:16:32.958
Here!

00:16:36.125 --> 00:16:38.792
Does the tarot even have that card?

00:16:38.792 --> 00:16:40.625
It's an original.

00:16:40.625 --> 00:16:42.583
What card is it?

00:16:42.583 --> 00:16:44.417
The flat-chested card.

00:16:44.417 --> 00:16:46.625
My breasts are just modest.

00:16:46.625 --> 00:16:48.458
"The Flat."

00:16:49.958 --> 00:16:51.792
I'm home.

00:16:53.958 --> 00:16:56.250
Welcome back.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.333
Meme, are you doing yoga?

00:16:58.333 --> 00:17:03.542
Yoga improves the blood flow,
so I thought it might help my memory.

00:17:03.542 --> 00:17:05.167
Oh, okay.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.292
Amazing.

00:17:23.667 --> 00:17:27.833
What did I do all day long?

00:17:35.625 --> 00:17:40.542
Geez, Meme, you're in my bed again-- Oh!

00:17:40.542 --> 00:17:42.375
Why are you naked?

00:17:42.375 --> 00:17:44.875
What did she do to end up like that?

00:17:44.875 --> 00:17:46.708
And she's gotten dirty here and there, too.

00:17:46.708 --> 00:17:49.875
They're doing physical fitness testing today.

00:17:49.875 --> 00:17:52.375
Please don't go using up your
strength so early in the morning.

00:17:52.375 --> 00:17:54.417
What do you mean by that?

00:17:59.542 --> 00:18:01.375
Hurry up and get changed.

00:18:01.375 --> 00:18:02.917
Man, you are so annoying.

00:18:02.917 --> 00:18:03.708
Hey!

00:18:03.708 --> 00:18:06.333
Stop talking to me, straight-laced chick.

00:18:06.792 --> 00:18:09.833
Miss Anya hasn't come out
of the changing room, huh?

00:18:09.833 --> 00:18:12.042
What could she be doing?

00:18:12.708 --> 00:18:16.208
These are the commoners'
clothing called gym shorts?

00:18:16.208 --> 00:18:21.083
You can see my buttocks
through this scandalous clothing!

00:18:21.083 --> 00:18:24.958
I have to wear this and
go out in front of others?!

00:18:24.958 --> 00:18:29.792
All right, those of you who are ready,
go on and start evaluating.

00:18:29.792 --> 00:18:32.333
Oh, Miss Anya!

00:18:32.333 --> 00:18:35.333
We're starting.

00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:36.917
What's the matter, Anya?

00:18:36.917 --> 00:18:39.667
You won't set any records wearing those.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.583
Is there some problem with that?

00:18:42.583 --> 00:18:46.292
No... If you're okay
with that, then I don't mind.

00:18:49.458 --> 00:18:52.250
It's just a fitness exam,
but they're even doing a shot put.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.625
Wow, what's with that?!

00:18:53.625 --> 00:18:55.083
He's super-fast!

00:18:57.875 --> 00:18:59.958
Akane, 6.32 seconds.

00:18:59.958 --> 00:19:02.083
Clay, 10.18 seconds.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.458
Don't overdo it too much.

00:19:07.292 --> 00:19:08.708
Amazing.

00:19:08.708 --> 00:19:10.458
Next up, Miss Anya.

00:19:13.042 --> 00:19:15.458
Here goes Anya Hepburn!

00:19:25.125 --> 00:19:28.500
1.87 meters! That's fantastic!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.625
That's the top score among all the new girls.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.125
This is Meme Tatane, first throw!

00:19:37.125 --> 00:19:38.458
It's your third.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.500
15.6 meters!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.167
All right!

00:19:49.167 --> 00:19:51.583
She's way ahead of the other girls.

00:19:51.583 --> 00:19:55.250
So are the shots put onto Tatane's chest.

00:19:56.833 --> 00:20:00.292
--This is Meme Tatane, first throw--
--You're done, already.

00:20:00.833 --> 00:20:05.167
Meme, too. I thought
she would be hard to figure,

00:20:05.167 --> 00:20:07.667
but she's really that amazing?

00:20:11.667 --> 00:20:14.833
Meme and Miss Anya are both incredible.

00:20:14.833 --> 00:20:16.750
And yet, I...

00:20:18.167 --> 00:20:19.833
I...

00:20:22.875 --> 00:20:24.667
Those who cannot do the Fosbury flop

00:20:24.667 --> 00:20:28.208
don't have to, and can do a belly roll instead.

00:20:28.208 --> 00:20:30.583
Here goes Tsugumi Harudori!

00:20:39.333 --> 00:20:40.875
Pathetic.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.792
I don't deserve to be asked to partner

00:20:44.792 --> 00:20:48.500
with Miss Anya or Meme like this.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.083
I just think about things that don't matter,

00:20:51.083 --> 00:20:53.542
and don't do anything.

00:20:53.542 --> 00:20:56.375
Even if I find a goal someday,

00:20:56.375 --> 00:21:00.542
I can't do anything the way I am.

00:21:15.583 --> 00:21:18.958
You tried hard during the fitness exams, huh?

00:21:18.958 --> 00:21:21.250
Akane...

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.750
I thought you might still be worried,

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.417
but judging from that, you seem okay.

00:21:26.417 --> 00:21:28.125
Oh, yes.

00:21:28.125 --> 00:21:30.917
I still don't have a goal or anything,

00:21:30.917 --> 00:21:33.375
but I'm going to try as hard as I can,

00:21:33.375 --> 00:21:36.083
so as not to be left behind
by Miss Anya and Meme.

00:21:36.083 --> 00:21:39.125
That's nice, and sounds just like you, Harudori.

00:21:39.125 --> 00:21:42.542
Thanks for everything you've done for me.

00:21:42.542 --> 00:21:46.417
Come to think of it, regarding
the chart Clay drew yesterday...

00:21:48.375 --> 00:21:51.625
I don't know what that means at all.

00:21:54.292 --> 00:21:56.375
No matter what those around you think,

00:21:56.375 --> 00:21:59.042
how about you care more
about your <i>own </i>feelings?

00:21:59.042 --> 00:22:01.250
Oh, right.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.208
Miss Tsugumi!

00:22:03.208 --> 00:22:04.750
What are you doing?

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:07.292
The fitness exams are starting!

00:22:07.292 --> 00:22:09.000
They just ended.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.500
Wait up!

00:22:13.625 --> 00:22:14.625
Seriously?

00:22:14.625 --> 00:22:16.500
Come, let's go home.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:19.292
You two were both amazing, huh?

00:22:19.292 --> 00:22:21.458
Huh? How so?

00:22:21.458 --> 00:22:23.250
Miss Tsugumi, you perv!

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:28.125
No, not that! Geez! All right,
race you to the changing room!

00:22:28.125 --> 00:22:30.167
Huh? What's suddenly come over her?

00:22:30.167 --> 00:22:31.750
Ready-set-go!

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:34.667
H-Hold on! No fair!

00:22:39.625 --> 00:22:42.250
Wait for me!

00:22:47.417 --> 00:22:51.583
<i>With a big wave and a "See you,"</i>

00:22:51.583 --> 00:22:58.333
<i>let's meet in the new day</i>

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:19.417
<i>Our shadows stretch along the pavement</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:23.375
<i>coming together, then apart, then together</i>

00:23:23.375 --> 00:23:31.750
<i>What do I say when the road home ends?</i>

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:35.875
<i>You are not alone. Nope, right nearby,</i>

00:23:35.875 --> 00:23:40.042
<i>there are eyes looking back at you</i>

00:23:40.042 --> 00:23:44.167
<i>And just like a miracle,</i>

00:23:44.167 --> 00:23:47.917
<i>they can turn even failures into laughter</i>

00:23:47.917 --> 00:23:52.042
<i>Thank you for a fun day</i>

00:23:52.042 --> 00:23:56.167
<i>Let's do it again tomorrow</i>

00:23:56.167 --> 00:24:00.458
<i>We'll open a brand-new door</i>

00:24:00.458 --> 00:24:04.500
<i>chasing after dreams and love</i>

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:09.833
<i>and those nameless feelings, too</i>

00:24:18.083 --> 00:24:21.958
I am the cupid of love. I lead
my lost sheep to the paradise of love

00:24:21.958 --> 00:24:25.583
with my clever strategies.
Just you wait, Jacqueline.

00:24:25.583 --> 00:24:26.750
After we clean the pool...

00:24:26.750 --> 00:24:27.917
...we refresh ourselves with a bath.

00:24:27.917 --> 00:24:29.083
I call this

00:24:29.083 --> 00:24:32.192
"Next time: Invitation Fighting!"
"Operation: Casual Conversation in the Bathroom."
